		},
		{
			"id":"3b3113c965dc0121",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"text":"What would happen if an attractive force (say gravitational force) suddenly became repulsive at a certain point in time?",
			"type":"text",
			"x":-720,
			"y":-1650,
			"width":400,
			"height":110
		},
		{
			"id":"0931bb994007c3f3",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"text":"Hole through the earth\n1. What would happen to the atmosphere as a result?\n2. How long would a \"free-fall\" trip take from one end to the other?",
